This package is a port of the `protocol` package from pi
(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi), pinned at commit
8eb2bccf2603c28907ef3a583a04cafb1af284ae.

Provenance: this is a fork-and-adapt port, not a clean-room reimplementation.
The upstream sources were read directly and their structure, naming and
algorithms were carried across; the changes are the adaptations to this
repository's runtime and module layout, summarized below and listed per file.

Adaptations, in order of how widely they apply:

  1. Every file: relative specifiers no longer carry a `.ts` suffix, as this
     repository's `check-ts-relative-imports` invariant requires.
  2. Class privacy: 30 `private` members across four files became ES `#private`
     fields, with their `this.<name>` references rewritten to `this.#<name>`.
  3. Validation: upstream used `typebox` (`Type` builders plus `Check` from
     `typebox/value`). That dependency is not carried over; schemas are built
     from `@oh-my-pi/omptype/typebox` instead. Two call-shape changes follow:
     `Type.Unsafe<JsonValue>(Type.Unknown())` becomes `Type.Unsafe<JsonValue>()`,
     because the facade's `Unsafe` takes an optional raw JSON Schema and ignores
     it; and `Check(schema, value)` becomes a discriminant test against the
     facade's `__validator`, which returns either the validated value or a
     failure carrying `message`. `codec.ts` routes both parse functions through
     one `isValid` helper, which also supplies the narrowing that `Check` used to
     provide implicitly.
  4. Tests: the runner moved from `vitest` to `bun:test`. The CBOR vectors,
     framing byte-loop cases and protocol fixtures are otherwise unchanged.

Added by this port, with no upstream counterpart: `src/index.ts` and
`src/protocol.ts` keep their upstream export lists; `LICENSE`, `NOTICE`,
`CHANGELOG.md`, `tsconfig.json` and `package.json` were rewritten for this
repository. Upstream's `vitest.config.ts`, `tsconfig.build.json` and
`tsconfig.test.json` were dropped — the runner change removes the first, and
AGENTS.md forbids the `tsc -p tsconfig.build.json` build the other two served.

Adapted files:
  src/cbor/decoder.ts
  src/cbor/encoder.ts
  src/cbor/index.ts
  src/codec.ts
  src/framing.ts
  src/index.ts
  src/protocol.ts

Copied verbatim:
  src/cbor/options.ts

